<div class="page-head"><div><h1>Duplicate <%= source.item.name %></h1><p>Create a separate product with the same tracking, units, description, exact variants and current selling prices. The new product starts with zero stock and no inventory value, serials, lots, orders or payment history.</p></div></div>
<section class="card card-body"><form method="post" action="/inventory/<%= source.item.id %>/duplicate" class="stack-form"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="sourceHash" value="<%= source.hash %>"><input type="hidden" name="idempotencyKey" value="<%= idempotencyKey %>">
<label class="field"><span>New product name</span><input class="input" name="name" value="<%= source.item.name %> copy" maxlength="240" required></label>
<label class="field"><span>New code prefix</span><input class="input" name="code" value="<%= source.item.base_code||source.skus[0]?.code||'PRODUCT' %>-COPY" maxlength="200" required></label>
<p><%= source.skus.length %> <%= helpers.plural(source.skus.length,'variant') %>. Each copied variant receives a new SKU. Existing records remain unchanged.</p>
<div class="table-scroll"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Source SKU</th><th>Variant</th><th>Selling price to copy</th></tr></thead><tbody><% source.skus.forEach(function(s){const price=source.prices.find(p=>p.sku_id===s.id); %><tr><td><%= s.code %></td><td><%= s.variant_label||'Default' %></td><td><%= price?helpers.money(price.amount_minor,price.currency):'Not set' %></td></tr><% }); %></tbody></table></div>
<button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Create this duplicate with zero stock</button></form></section>
